{"seq":2,"slug":"time-performance","title":"时间系统性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/practice/time-performance","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"时间系统性能\">时间系统性能</h1><p>一座城镇两百个 NPC、上千块田地的作物、几百盏随昼夜开关的灯，全都订阅着同一条时间轴——如果每个订阅者每帧都被叫醒检查「轮到我了吗」，光是这份空转就能吃掉几毫秒帧预算，在手机上直接掉帧。时间系统的性能挑战不在算得多复杂，而在订阅者多到「逐个轮询」本身成了瓶颈。这一篇讲如何用分桶、事件驱动、变化阈值把这份开销压回可控范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时间系统的开销有三个来源，治理手法各不相同。<strong>订阅者轮询</strong>：海量对象每帧问「该更新了吗」，绝大多数答案是「还没」——纯浪费。<strong>渲染参数刷新</strong>：太阳方向、天色、光照每帧重算，但其实变化极缓慢。<strong>离线追赶</strong>：读档瞬间补跑大量逻辑，造成加载卡顿。核心原则一句话：<strong>让开销正比于「真正发生变化的量」，而非「订阅者的总数」</strong>。</p>\n<p>下图把这三类开销与对应优化手段对应起来：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[海量订阅者每帧轮询] --&gt; B[时间分桶&lt;br/&gt;每帧只更新一桶]&#10;    A --&gt; C[事件驱动&lt;br/&gt;到点才唤醒]&#10;    D[渲染参数每帧重算] --&gt; E[变化阈值&lt;br/&gt;相位变化超阈值才刷新]&#10;    D --&gt; F[降频更新&lt;br/&gt;每 N 帧或固定 Hz]&#10;    G[离线读档补跑] --&gt; H[批量结算&lt;br/&gt;闭式公式取代逐 tick]&#10;    G --&gt; I[追赶封顶 + 分帧摊销]\">flowchart TD\n    A[海量订阅者每帧轮询] --&gt; B[时间分桶&lt;br/&gt;每帧只更新一桶]\n    A --&gt; C[事件驱动&lt;br/&gt;到点才唤醒]\n    D[渲染参数每帧重算] --&gt; E[变化阈值&lt;br/&gt;相位变化超阈值才刷新]\n    D --&gt; F[降频更新&lt;br/&gt;每 N 帧或固定 Hz]\n    G[离线读档补跑] --&gt; H[批量结算&lt;br/&gt;闭式公式取代逐 tick]\n    G --&gt; I[追赶封顶 + 分帧摊销]</pre><p>几种优化手段的适用场景与代价对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>把开销从…降到…</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件驱动队列</td>\n<td>O(N) 轮询 → O(到点数)</td>\n<td>实现稍复杂</td>\n<td>定时器、日程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间分桶</td>\n<td>全量/帧 → 全量/N 帧</td>\n<td>单体更新有延迟</td>\n<td>作物、可更新对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化阈值</td>\n<td>每帧刷新 → 变化才刷</td>\n<td>需存上次值</td>\n<td>光照、天空参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降频/固定 Hz</td>\n<td>60Hz → 如 10Hz</td>\n<td>视觉略阶梯</td>\n<td>远景光照、环境光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LOD 时间更新</td>\n<td>全精度 → 按距离降精</td>\n<td>远处不精确</td>\n<td>离屏 NPC、远景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动取代轮询\">事件驱动取代轮询</h2><p>最大的浪费是「主动轮询」：每个定时器、每个 NPC 每帧都检查时钟问「到我了吗」。把它反转成<strong>事件驱动</strong>——对象不主动问，而是把自己注册进 <a href=\"../systems/time-driven-events\">时间驱动事件</a> 的优先队列，到点了系统才回调它。这样每帧的开销只正比于「这一帧真正到点的事件数」，而非订阅者总数。一千个静默等待的定时器，开销几乎为零；只有队首到点时才有工作。</p>\n<p>这是从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的根本改善（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为订阅总数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为当帧触发数，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ll N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）。NPC 日程、作物生长、商店刷新都应走这条路：不要「每帧检查每个 NPC 的日程」，而是「把每个 NPC 下一个日程切换时刻入队」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间分桶-把更新摊到多帧\">时间分桶：把更新摊到多帧</h2><p>有些对象确实需要周期性更新而非纯事件触发——比如上千块田地每游戏分钟做一次生长结算。若同一 tick 全部更新，会出现「每到整分钟卡一下」的周期性卡顿。<strong>时间分桶 (time bucketing)</strong> 把对象按 id 散列进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个桶，每帧只更新一个桶，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 帧轮完一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 把 N 个可更新对象分成 bucketCount 桶，每帧更新一桶&#10;int bucket = frameCount % bucketCount;&#10;for (int i = bucket; i &lt; updatables.Count; i += bucketCount)&#10;    updatables[i].TickTime(deltaPerBucket); // 累计本桶应补的时间量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 把 N 个可更新对象分成 bucketCount 桶，每帧更新一桶</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>int bucket = frameCount % bucketCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (int i = bucket; i &#x3C; updatables.Count; i += bucketCount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    updatables[i].TickTime(deltaPerBucket); // 累计本桶应补的时间量</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代价是单个对象的更新有最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 帧的延迟，但对作物生长这类玩家无法察觉毫秒级延迟的系统完全可接受。换来的是把一次性的大尖峰摊成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 帧的平缓负载，帧时间曲线立刻变平。这种「数据分桶、批量处理」的思路与数据导向设计同源，详见性能 hub 的缓存与数据导向一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渲染参数的变化阈值与降频\">渲染参数的变化阈值与降频</h2><p>太阳方向、天空颜色、环境光每帧都在变，但变化极其缓慢——一天压成十分钟，相位每帧也只挪万分之几。每帧重算整套光照（尤其涉及环境光探针、天空查表）是奢侈的。两个手段：<strong>变化阈值</strong>——只在相位变化累计超过某阈值（如 0.001）时才刷新光照，否则沿用上次结果；<strong>降频更新</strong>——把昼夜光照刷新固定到较低频率（如每秒 10 次），用插值填补帧间。</p>\n<p>人眼对缓慢的光照变化不敏感，10Hz 刷新加帧间插值在视觉上与每帧刷新几乎无差，却把光照重算开销降到六分之一。这与昼夜调校的「过渡平滑」需求一致——见 <a href=\"day-night-tuning\">昼夜调校</a>，只是这里关注的是性能而非手感。全局光照的昼夜更新分摊（见 <a href=\"../day-night/time-lighting\">昼夜光照</a>）是这套思路开销最大的一环，常用「每帧更新一小片探针网格」的方式跨多帧摊销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离线追赶的开销控制\">离线追赶的开销控制</h2><p>读档时的离线追赶（见 <a href=\"time-save-state\">时间状态存档</a>）是另一个尖峰来源：离线七天、每十分钟一个作物 tick，朴素补跑要执行上千次。两条对策与前文呼应。<strong>批量结算</strong>优先：能用闭式公式算出最终状态的（纯累积型产出），就别逐 tick 跑——把「跑 1000 次生长」换成「直接算 1000 次后的结果」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>分帧摊销</strong>兜底：必须逐 tick 补跑的（有随机分支或副作用），把追赶切成每帧补一小段，配一个加载进度条，避免主线程一次性卡死。</p>\n<p>定位这些尖峰要靠 profiler：用帧时间分析找出「整分钟卡顿」「读档长卡」的具体调用栈，再针对性地分桶或结算。性能定位的方法见性能 hub 的剖析工具一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>核心原则：让开销正比于「真正变化的量」，而非订阅者总数；轮询是最大的浪费。</li>\n<li>用事件驱动优先队列取代逐帧轮询，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 订阅检查降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 当帧触发数。</li>\n<li>必须周期更新的对象用时间分桶，每帧更新一桶，把大尖峰摊成多帧平缓负载。</li>\n<li>渲染参数用变化阈值 + 降频（如 10Hz）+ 帧间插值，光照重算开销可降数倍而肉眼无差。</li>\n<li>离线追赶优先批量结算（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)\\to O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），不可结算的分帧摊销 + 进度条；尖峰定位靠 profiler。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../systems/time-driven-events\">时间驱动事件</a> —— 事件驱动队列的实现；<a href=\"time-save-state\">时间状态存档</a> —— 离线追赶的来源；<a href=\"../day-night/time-lighting\">昼夜光照</a> —— GI 与光照刷新的开销大头。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：分桶/批处理背后的数据导向设计见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">缓存与数据导向</a>；帧时间尖峰的定位见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/practice/profiling-tools\">剖析工具</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时间系统性能","id":"时间系统性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动取代轮询","id":"事件驱动取代轮询"},{"level":2,"text":"时间分桶：把更新摊到多帧","id":"时间分桶-把更新摊到多帧"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染参数的变化阈值与降频","id":"渲染参数的变化阈值与降频"},{"level":2,"text":"离线追赶的开销控制","id":"离线追赶的开销控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"时间状态存档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/practice/time-save-state"},"next":{"title":"昼夜调校","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/practice/day-night-tuning"}}